# Verify: original/output hash, ELF64 executable VA, decoded sign bit/target, exact two caller contexts/prologue/epilogue; negative source/target/caller/output rejection; disassembly; real Debug JNI/MemInfoReader child and SystemServer runtime. Full188-patch replay recorded separately.
